{"suttaId":"tha-ap28","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3011,3024],"vripara":"161"},"segments":{"tha-ap28:0.3":"Dhūpadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap28:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap28:1.3":"Kuṭidhūpaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap28:2.1":"Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap28:2.3":"Sabbesampi piyo homi, dhūpadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap28:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ dhūpamadadiṃ tadā [yaṃ dhūpanamadāsahaṃ (ka.)];","tha-ap28:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dhūpadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap28:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap28:4.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap28:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā dhūpadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap28:6.1":"Dhūpadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
